    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "5xx 錯誤率",
      "description": "5xx 佔所有請求的比例；4xx 是呼叫端的問題，不算在這裡",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
